# Pastoria City (its own theme in the original: the humid town at the edge of the Great Marsh, wooden houses on
# boardwalks, Croagunk grinning by the water, a Gym of pools led by a wrestler): a lively, cheeky D-dorian romp, the
# clarinet hopping in octaves over a bouncing bass and an accordion's off-beats, a marimba hopping back and dripping
# like a wet boardwalk, brass swaggering in the bridge. Original composition for this game.
